Description: STAR-suite binary package for STAR, SLAM, Flex, and perturb tooling
 STAR-suite extends upstream STAR with integrated modules for SLAM-seq,
 Flex processing, perturb-seq compatibility, and helper tools.
 .
 This package installs core executable binaries used in STAR-suite runtime and
 release workflows.
